# Earthbeat UI conventions

Visual source of truth: `docs/earthbeat-ui-eggshell-minimal.png` and `docs/ui-conventions.md`.

## Colors

- Define raw colors only in `client/src/styles/tokens.css`
- In CSS/TSX use `var(--token)` or Tailwind **semantic** classes (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `border-border`, …)
- Never add hex, `rgb()`, `hsl()`, `oklch()`, or `color-mix()` outside tokens
- Never use Tailwind palette classes (`bg-zinc-100`, `text-blue-500`) or arbitrary colors (`bg-[#…]`)
- Accents: live / destructive only

## Look

- Eggshell ground, plain black hairlines, flat fills
- No soft shadows, glows, gradients, glass, or neumorphism
- Keep DM Sans / Syne — do not reintroduce Geist or preset marketing fonts

## Components (required for agents)

**App chrome must use shadcn** — do not invent parallel Button / Input / Dialog / Select / Tabs / Dropdown / Checkbox / Switch / Popover / Sheet / Tooltip components.

1. Check `client/src/components/ui` for an existing primitive
2. If missing, add it: `pnpm --dir client dlx shadcn@latest add <name>`
3. Import from `@/components/ui/...` and style with semantic tokens only

**Allowed to hand-build** (instrument / canvas surface):

- React Flow nodes, edges, handles, and canvas chrome
- Waveform / monitor SVG and live readouts
- Node palette icons and patch-specific graph UI
- Shell layout structure in `index.css` (header/sidebar/footer grid)

Do not hand-roll a second design system beside shadcn for forms, dialogs, menus, or toolbar controls.

## Verify

Run `pnpm --dir client lint` after UI changes. Lint includes `check-theme-contrast.mjs` for light and dark surface/ink token pairs.
